# Reference checksums of the screenshots of the BIOS scenarios (tests/native/bios.inject): VBE modes set from the kernel after boot,
# then the text screen after INT 10h AX=0003h. The same three values come out of QEMU's std, cirrus and vmware cards.
# NAME WIDTHxHEIGHT CRC-32 of the RGB bytes of the PPM that the monitor's screendump writes. tools/native-shot.py check compares them.
vbe-640 640x480 84cd5f8b
vbe-800 800x600 2c094efc
text 720x400 3eeee6dd
